<view class="screen"><view class="page-head"><view><view class="eyebrow">GESTURE LIBRARY</view><view class="page-title">手势库</view><view class="page-copy">本机保存，导出后可在其他设备导入。</view></view><status-badge tone="info" text="本地存储" /></view><view class="card"><input class="input" placeholder="搜索手势名称或文字" value="{{query}}" bindinput="search" /><view class="button-row"><button class="secondary-button" bindtap="importLibrary">导入</button><button class="secondary-button" bindtap="exportLibrary">导出</button></view></view><view class="card"><section-header title="已保存手势" copy="关闭的手势不会参与实时识别。" action="新增" bind:action="add" /><view wx:if="{{!items.length}}" class="empty-state">暂无手势。先记录一个动作，让实时翻译有可识别的目标。</view><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="gesture-row"><view class="gesture-head"><view><view class="list-title">{{item.name}}</view><view class="list-copy">{{item.action}}</view></view><view class="category">{{item.categoryLabel}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{item.needsResample}}" class="resample-notice">需重新采样：此旧模板没有可靠的采样手指掩码，已禁止自动匹配。完成采样后可替换原模板。</view><view class="gesture-meta">更新于 {{item.time}} · 姿态匹配 {{item.matchPose ? '开' : '关'}}</view><view class="gesture-meta">保存时弯曲度（左／右均按拇指、食指、中指、无名指、小指排列）</view><view class="gesture-meta">左手：{{item.fingers[0]}} / {{item.fingers[1]}} / {{item.fingers[2]}} / {{item.fingers[3]}} / {{item.fingers[4]}}</view><view class="gesture-meta">右手：{{item.fingers[5]}} / {{item.fingers[6]}} / {{item.fingers[7]}} / {{item.fingers[8]}} / {{item.fingers[9]}}</view><button wx:if="{{item.needsResample}}" class="resample-button" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="resample">重新采样并替换</button><view class="actions"><button class="small-button" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="edit">改文字</button><button class="small-button" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="toggle">{{item.enabled ? '停用' : '启用'}}</button><button class="small-danger" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="remove">删除</button></view></view></view></view>
